  "limits": [
    "These are scoped controls on one Windows host and pinned CLI, not a guarantee that all service-created processes or future executor configurations join the caller job.",
    "The generic runner still records service_created_processes_tracked=false; this research does not silently change that statement.",
    "The child-stop wait runs after the parent runner returns. It does not measure latency from the original timeout deadline or establish a cancellation SLA.",
    "I/O accounting is not physical allocation, total workspace size, a file count limit or an I/O-rate limit.",
    "No production write-budget enforcement or workspace free-space guard has been added by this research.",
    "No real model inference, official model score or skill-performance gain was measured; the public model launch guard remains closed."
